    <mxCell id="title_note" value="StaffSync EER — corrected. Bugs fixed vs. the original: no self-loops, every relationship edge is bound to a real shape, Is_Read moved onto Receives (was wrongly on Notification under an M:N), duplicate relationship names resolved, dead-end Coordinator/In-Charge subclasses now carry real relationships, Workload Task's redundant Delegates+Assigned-to collapsed to one relationship, Chat Room scoped to Course (not 1:1 with a Workload Task) with a new Participates In membership relationship, Support Request added (distinct from Reschedule Request). See docs/DESIGN_PATTERNS_PLAN.md sibling doc database/README.md for the physical mapping." parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;">
      <mxGeometry x="60" y="-60" width="1400" height="80" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

